T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   A Virtual Private Network \(VPN\) creates an encrypted, secure logical tunnel across an untrusted) Tj
T*
(   public network \(the Internet\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   IPsec Architectural Protocols:) Tj
T*
(   1. Authentication Header \(AH, Protocol 51\): Provides connectionless integrity, data origin) Tj
T*
(   authentication, and replay protection across the entire packet \(including IP header\), but) Tj
T*
