T*
(   Core Components:) Tj
T*
(   - Client \(Principal\), Application Server \(SS\), and Key Distribution Center \(KDC\) comprising) Tj
T*
(   Authentication Server \(AS\) and Ticket Granting Server \(TGS\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Three-Phase Exchange:) Tj
T*
(   1. Authentication Service Exchange: Client authenticates to AS with username. AS validates user) Tj
T*
(   and returns a Ticket Granting Ticket \(TGT\) encrypted with TGS secret key, along with a) Tj
T*
(   client/TGS session key encrypted with client's password hash.) Tj
T*
(   2. Ticket-Granting Service Exchange: Client presents the TGT and an Authenticator to the TGS) Tj
T*
(   requesting access to a specific Application Server. TGS decrypts TGT, validates Authenticator,) Tj
T*
(   and issues a Service Ticket encrypted with the Application Server's secret key.) Tj
T*
(   3. Client/Server Exchange: Client sends the Service Ticket and Authenticator to the Application) Tj
T*
(   Server. Server decrypts ticket, authenticates the client, and optionally returns a mutual) Tj
T*
(   authentication confirmation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
